<title>GERMANY: Bankgesellschaft 96 net, oper profit slides.</title>
<headline>Bankgesellschaft 96 net, oper profit slides.</headline>
<dateline>BERLIN 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Calendar 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Group oper profit after provisions    355    vs 958</p>
<p>    Group net profit			    47     vs 476</p>
<p>    Group oper profit before provisions   1,775  up 5.6 pct</p>
<p>    Dividend (proposed)			 1.10   vs 1.10 dmk</p>
<p>    Group balance sheet total		 337,500 up 19.9 pct</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German bank is Bankgesellschaft Berlin AG. The bank said the fall in operating profit after risk provisions was due to a sharp need in the requirement for risk provisions.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
